        "TileImage": "$($repository 729aa28f-5856-449a-9e41-3e4fedc5c38f).Image",
        "Description": "The Vatican has uncovered that Padre Francesco has been selling indulgences to members of his congregation such as the Saltatore brothers as well as less pious denizens of Sapienza such as the local Bohemian crowd. The Pope himself has ordered that a secret 21st Century crusade be conducted in Sapienza to rectify these issues. Umberto Megazzini must also be eliminated publicly to atone for the unspeakable acts that he committed following his theft of the Chronovisor from the Vatican.",
